# Build-context hygiene for image builds that use the repo root as context
# (dev/dashboard.Dockerfile). Keeps host-native + heavy artifacts OUT of the
# context/image so the build is small and reproducible (dashboard-manualchunks-tdz-fix
# T2.1 / EC-1). Without this, host node_modules (host-native esbuild/rollup binaries)
# would be copied in and break `npm ci`.
**/node_modules
.git
**/.git
dashboard/dist
bin
*.log
coverage.out
*.testcoverage.yml
